700	     * Computes the size of the owner's household: the number of existing owners already sharing the given
701	     * {@code householdId} plus the owner being created itself. The existing count is taken before the new
702	     * owner is persisted, so adding one for the owner yields the household's total membership including it
703	     * (e.g. two existing members give a household size of 3 for the third member). Households are keyed on
704	     * the deterministic {@code householdId} (derived from last name and postcode).
705	     *
706	     * @param householdId the computed household identifier of the owner being created
707	     * @return the household size including the owner being created (at least 1)
708	     */
709	    private int countHouseholdSize(String householdId) {
710	        long existing = this.clinicService.findAllOwners().stream()
711	            .filter(owner -> householdId.equals(owner.getHouseholdId()))
712	            .count();
