816	    /**
817	     * Adjusts an effective registration date so that it always falls on a business day. When the given
818	     * date is a Saturday, a Sunday or a listed public holiday it is rolled forward one day at a time until
819	     * it reaches the next non-holiday business day; a weekday that is not a holiday is returned unchanged.
820	     * This applies equally to a date supplied in the request and to a date defaulted to the server date, and
821	     * the adjusted value is what becomes the owner's {@code registrationDate}, so every value derived from it
822	     * (the membership number's year segment, the daily create-limit count) uses the business-day-adjusted
823	     * date.
