847	    /**
848	     * Determines whether the owner being created lands on a day that already holds a bulk sign-up surge,
849	     * i.e. more than {@link #BULK_SIGNUP_WARNING_THRESHOLD} owners already share its {@code registrationDate}.
850	     * The count is taken before the new owner is persisted, so it excludes the owner being created, mirroring
851	     * the daily create-limit rule's accumulation path.
